   "text": "Yes, he is awake and talking to me. I don't know if he has chest pain.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:07",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.responsive+danger_signs.chest_pain_now"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Since he's talking with you, could you ask him whether his chest hurts or feels tight right now?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:15",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.chest_pain_now"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He says no, his chest doesn't hurt or feel tight.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:17",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.chest_pain_now"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for asking him. Is he having any trouble breathing right now, and is he bleeding heavily anywhere?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:24",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, he isn't having trouble breathing and there is no heavy bleeding.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:26",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:danger_signs.breathing_difficulty+danger_signs.heavy_bleeding"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "What is the main problem that brings him in today? Please tell me in your own words, and when it started.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:33",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.category+complaint.text+complaint.onset"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "My father fell down four steps at home an hour ago and landed on his right hip. He can't stand up and is in a lot of pain.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:34",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.category+complaint.text+complaint.onset"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thank you for telling me what happened. How old is your father?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:50",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:patient.age"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He is 87 years old.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:13:51",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:patient.age"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Has your father had a fever, and if you took his temperature, what was it? Have you noticed any new rash on him?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:01",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.fever+infection.rash"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "No, he hasn't had a fever and I haven't seen any new rashes.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:03",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.fever+infection.rash"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "In the last two weeks, has he travelled overseas, or been around anyone who was sick with something catching?",
