   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He is awake and talking, but he's in a lot of pain from his hip.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:20",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks, that helps. Apart from the pain, is he his normal self, or does anything about the way he's thinking or acting seem different from usual?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:34",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He is awake and talking, but he's in a lot of pain. I don't see anything else different about his behavior.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:35",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:ams.changed_from_baseline"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Got it, no other changes. On a scale from 0 to 10, where 10 is the worst pain imaginable, how bad is his hip pain right now, and is it getting worse and worse, with his hip or leg feeling tight or hard?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:44",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating+complaint.compartment_syndrome_symptoms"
  },
  {
