   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating+complaint.compartment_syndrome_symptoms"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks, that's noted. Does he take a blood thinner, like warfarin, apixaban, rivaroxaban or clopidogrel, and what other medicines does he take regularly? You can also send a photo of the boxes.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:55",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:M.anticoagulant+M.medications"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "He takes a small pill to thin his blood called warfarin. He also takes a blood pressure pill, but I don't know the name of it.",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 20:14:57",
   "kind": "answer",
   "slot": "dyn:M.anticoagulant+M.medications"
  },
  {
   "role": "system",
   "text": "floor: at least ESI-2  rules: ['B-30.anticoagulated-trauma']",
